<title>USA: Camden Property Trust ups yearly dividend.</title>
<headline>Camden Property Trust ups yearly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Camden Property Trust said late Wednesday that it is raising its dividend to $1.96 per share for 1997, up from $1.90.</p>
<p>The company said the increase will go into effect with the first quarter 1997 dividend to be declared in March and paid in April.</p>
<p>&quot;Management believes that the increased dividend of $1.96 can be achieved and still be consistent with the company's strategy of lowering the dividend payout ratio in 1997,&quot; the company said in a release.</p>
</text>
